commit e65dbaf804beacf4faa9e0354077e97d8c53b717
Author: VigM95 <vigneshmurali0412@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 3 22:04:43 2026 -0400

    feat: OSS extract — local skillgate check with proof matrix
    
    * docs: plan OSS extract + Docker for public skillgate repo
    
    Phase 1 plan only. Allowlist copy from private skillgate-ai, hosted
    deny-list, PyPI name skillgate-ai (skillgate taken), and Docker design
    following docker-project-foundations and docker-build-strategies
    (ENTRYPOINT skillgate, default check, not serve).
    
    Co-authored-by: VigM95 <vigneshm1995personal@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    * Extract allowlisted gate modules from skillgate-ai@6372ba1.
    
    Copy suite, pack, scorers, sandbox, report, eval_config, live, metrics, spans, usage, and case_pack as-is, plus Apache-2.0 LICENSE. Stub case_pack._template_trust so the OSS tree does not import skillgate_ai.wizard.
    
    Co-authored-by: VigM95 <vigneshm1995personal@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    * feat: implement OSS local gate (check, packs, Docker, CI)
    
    Allowlist copy from skillgate-ai@6372ba1 (not filter-repo). Adds
    `skillgate check` exit 0/1 with pack-local evals/history JSONL, stripped
    hosted deps (no FastAPI/Neon/SIWV/vault), pdf twins, and a multi-stage
    non-root CLI image (ENTRYPOINT skillgate, CMD check /pack).
    
    Co-authored-by: VigM95 <vigneshm1995personal@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    * fix: allow Docker /pack mount; add Phase 3 live proof matrix
    
    Ingest required SKILL.md name == folder basename, so
    `docker run -v skill:/pack` always failed. Treat basename `pack` as
    the documented container mount. Capture live pip/CLI/pytest/Docker
    red+green logs under docs/proof/.
    
    Co-authored-by: VigM95 <vigneshm1995personal@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
    Co-authored-by: VigM95 <vigneshm1995personal@users.noreply.github.com>

